# Documents & Legal (not code)
#
# The markdown docs ARE committed. privacy-accuracy.test.ts reads the Systems
# Guide to prove it no longer claims PostHog is anonymous, and a guard that
# reads a file only present on one person's Mac passes there and fails in CI,
# which is exactly how it sat broken for six weeks (#499). A doc the product
# makes a legal claim about belongs in git with the code it describes.
#
# The binaries (the brand kit PDF, the PRD .docx) stay out: they diff badly
# and nothing tests them.
Documents/*
!Documents/*.md

# The PRD stays out, for now and for a stated reason rather than by oversight.
# It was written in April with em dashes in it, and the pre-push style gate
# refuses them. Bringing it in means editing the punctuation of a record
# somebody wrote, which is a different act from moving that record into git.
# #496 already needs it edited (it states a family price the product does not
# charge); it can come in on that change, rewritten deliberately.
Documents/NurseDex_PRD_v2.md
Legal/

